sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Visitor
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>BrowsePage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>SearchProjectsBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>SearchProjectsController
  participant InteriorDesignProject as «entity»<br/>InteriorDesignProject
  participant DesignerCompany as «entity»<br/>DesignerCompany
  participant ProjectImage as «entity»<br/>ProjectImage
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: search and filter IDPs by keyword, category, budget, status and designer
  UI->>B: GET /api/projects (JWT)
  B->>C: search(InteriorDesignProject.SearchCriteria criteria, Pageable pageable)
  C->>InteriorDesignProject: search()
  InteriorDesignProject->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>InteriorDesignProject: rows
  InteriorDesignProject-->>C: result
  C->>DesignerCompany: findByDesigners()
  DesignerCompany->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>DesignerCompany: rows
  DesignerCompany-->>C: result
  C->>ProjectImage: coverKeys()
  ProjectImage->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>ProjectImage: rows
  ProjectImage-->>C: result
  C-->>B: PageResponse<ProjectCard>
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result